<details class="news-item"><summary><time>Aug 2025</time><span>TEACHING</span><strong>Awarded Fellowship of the Higher Education Academy</strong><i aria-hidden="true"></i></summary><div><p>I have successfully completed the Postgraduate Certificate in Academic Practice programme at the University of Hull. As a result, I have been awarded the Fellowship of the Higher Education Academy.</p></div></details>
